; mis-encodes -- the ISA defines SHL as dst,count)
SHL P5, 1
SHL P5, 1
SHL P5, 1
SHL P5, 1
SHL P5, 1
SHL P5, 1
SHL P5, 1
SHL P5, 1
OR P4, P5
MOV [P1], P4
PUSH P3
RET
